<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Graafschap Doetinchem 1 (Ibrahim 2) Volendam 0. Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 8,100.</p>
<p>Utrecht 1 (Van Burik 64) Roda JC Kerkrade 1 (Sibon 56).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance 10,500.</p>
<p>AZ Alkmaar 2 (Inia 67, Huysen 72) RKC Waalwijk 1 (Hill 46).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance not available.</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 1 (Jeffrey 67) Twente Enschede 1 (Bosman 51).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance 4,000.</p>
